==English==

===Etymology===
[[w:Galvani|Galvani]] + [[-ize]]. Galvani was the discoverer of the process.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈgælvænaɪz/}}

===Alternative spellings===
* [[galvanise]] (''mostly UK'')

===Verb===
{{en-verb|galvaniz|ing}}

# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North American|chemistry}} To coat with a thin layer of [[metal]] by [[electrochemical]] means; to [[electroplate]].
# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North American}} To coat with rust-resistant [[zinc]]
# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North American}} To [[shock]] or [[stimulate]] into sudden activity

